 but  even if it is even if i were to grant  that which honestly  i'm not sure i would  but  even if i do grant that  so what  sometimes the best way to make a point  is to take it to its logical extreme to  highlight the problems with that system  with that methodology with that mindset  highlight them at their most magnified  and have people realize okay  corporations aren't charging us to  breathe  but  they are  charging us and controlling a great deal  of vital resources we need to just live  and maybe to a greater extent than is  good or healthy for anybody other than  them  so even if you think this exaggeration  is so far  from the reality that  that'll never happen doesn't matter it  doesn't matter if it would never happen  because the mentality behind  the corporation  that  decides to just get rid of its workers  when they aren't doing a good enough job  that mentality exists now  and even if it's not resulting in people  suddenly having their oxygen taken away  from them it is at the heart  again of capitalism of large corporate  mentality especially  and this  it does what socially conscious sci-fi  is built  to do  take something going on extrapolate it  out to its most extreme  in the future with foreign technology  and make it clear the problems that this  blown up version is showing you  are real now  even if on a smaller scale i think it is  a masterfully done piece of political  entertainment and it's my pick for the  best political episode of doctor who  what are your picks for the best  political episodes whatever they are  drop something down the comments and  let's talk about it i've got a patreon  there's a link up there rewards for  every tier you can see videos up to a  week in advance also you can get your  name in the credits you're gonna start  seeing those in just a minute but even  if you're not able to do that there's  also youtube memberships with some other  perks but even if you can't do that like  share subscribe helps me out helps me  battle the freaking algorithm  but even if you can't do that  it's okay  because at the end of the day  you are the council i'm just running the  meetings and until next time this  council  is adjourned  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Music]  um  [Music]
 

